-- CAPABILITY ------------- errors/capture_escape_5.march

`h` cannot leave the `File.with_open` callback, but it is kept by `signal_watch`. [capture_escape]

6 |       Signal.watch(Signal.Term, fn () ->
          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

    `h` is a scoped handle: it is only good until the `File.with_open` callback returns (line 5).
    How `h` gets there: line 7: captures `h`; line 6: calls `Signal.watch`.
    Read what you need inside the callback and return the data instead.
    run `march --explain capture_escape`


